cff-version: 1.2.0
title: ABC-cluster manuscript assets
message: If you use these assets, please cite both this record and the ABC-cluster manuscript.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/abhi18av-phd-projects/abc-cluster-manuscript-assets"
abstract: >-
  Deployment templates and a reviewer protocol for ABC-cluster, a command-line platform that
  delivers batch pipeline execution, interactive analysis and data-app hosting on commodity,
  heterogeneous and intermittently connected hardware. Provides Pulumi Multipass templates for
  the two recommended deployment topologies, a worked example, and the reference output a
  correct run produces.
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - genomic surveillance
  - HashiCorp Nomad
  - Nextflow
  - reproducibility
  - low-resource settings
  - infrastructure as code
version: 0.1.0
